@startuml application-lifecycle-en
' SPDX-License-Identifier: Community-Spec-1.0
' State diagram of an application file (spec/en/lifecycle.adoc, APP-030 to APP-032, APP-038, APP-051, APP-057).
title State diagram of an application file
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
[*] --> draft
draft --> submitted : submit
draft --> [*] : purge after notice
submitted --> in_review : start review
submitted --> information_requested : open request
submitted --> decided : decision record
submitted --> withdrawn : withdraw
in_review --> information_requested : open request
in_review --> decided : decision record
in_review --> withdrawn : withdraw
information_requested --> in_review : reply or cancel
information_requested --> decided : decision record, not adverse
information_requested --> withdrawn : withdraw
information_requested --> closed : request expired and contact attempt logged
state "in-review" as in_review
state "information-requested" as information_requested
decided --> [*]
withdrawn --> [*]
closed --> [*]
@enduml
